# Colosseum's own scripts (src/orre/orre_vm.c; docs/ORRE_HANDOFF.md "Colosseum's scripts"): at the OUTSKIRT STAND the
# room's main loop (its floor record's + 0x34, function 11 of S1_out.scd) sees story flag 986 set (`mp orreflag`, the
# arrival scene's) and starts WILLIE's scene (function 9) as Colosseum does: his words (20792 "Yo! Wait! Wait up!", the
# battle question 20807 with its YES / NO), battle 10 through Kai's battle, his loss lines (20805) and the flags the
# scene sets (990, 2650, 991). WILLIE (person 3) is on the map as the scene shows him and walks where it says
# (src/orre/orre_npcs.c), stopping two steps south of the player; once the scene is over the room's set-up shows him
# standing at his place, and A in front of him runs his own talk script (0x0100000D: 20790). Needs ORRE's packs.
# Shots s_*.png.
MODE=1
TMO=600
WARP=45,0,33,40
ENV_A="MOEMON_DEBUG_PARTY=280:50,280:50 MOEMON_ORRE_SCRIPTS=1 MOEMON_ORRE_VM_TRACE=1"
EXPECT_A=("orre vm: room 1 (S1_out): main 0100000B" "orre vm: message 20792" "orre vm: message 20807"
          "orre: battle 10 (kind 2" "orre: battle 10 won" "orre vm: message 20805" "[test] orreget 0x3DE 1" "[test] orreget 0xA5A 1"
          "orre npcs: 3 shown at 31,32" "orre npcs: 3 walked to 25,30" "orre npcs: room 1, 7 people, 1 shown"
          "orre vm: talk to person 3: 0100000D" "orre vm: message 20790")
UNEXPECT_A=("[crash]" "TIMEOUT" "unknown code")
